  "provenance": "Dedicated native Canvas UI, independently generated extruded glyph mesh from OFL Geist outlines, individually rotated3Dletters, independently authored3Draymarched reflective smooth-union sphere/roundedbox shader,1066beveledmesh cubes with white clock/16orange center pixels, complete native phone and backwards-scrubbing timeline editor. No source videos/images/screens/frames loaded by runtime. Original soundtrack is comparison material;waveform fixture is derived RMS from that soundtrack.",
  "visual_status": "independent-reconstruction-needs-work",
  "editable": "project.json48actual chronologicalparts,colors,mesh-grid andcenter-pixel mask,12observedlayer names,8chapters andwaveform fixture;composition.js explicitsource-specific mechanisms",
  "differences": [
    "OFL Geist and JetBrainsMono substitute exact source font; type weight interpolation, per-letter bounce, outline stroke and kerning vary.",
    "Actual3Dglyph mesh is independently generated from font alpha with front/back/side walls. Camera direction and cap/side colors have been matched against enlarged source frames, but original bevel, contour, depth, lighting, spin phase and portal camera remain visibly different.",
    "Silver liquid uses authored3Draymarch of four smooth-union spheres and roundedbox; its lobe topology and silver/red material are recognizable but original reflector geometry, surface reflections, undercuts and merge choreography remain visibly different.",
    "Phone is an independently drawn fullUI/device with perspective/shear; exact material, projection, counter number-roll and glare are approximations.",
    "1066beveledcubes and16orange pixels/white clock ring are actual3Dgeometry. Heights, ring thickness and camera were corrected against source; original rounded-cube contour, glossy/shadow material, dynamic clock assignment and camera remain different. This is still needs-work rather than a high-fidelity replica.",
    "Editor recreates12layers,8chapters,backwardseek,parametergraph and soundtrack RMSwaveform; original application is not recovered and no real rendering task/backend executes.",
    "All892originalframes14.866667seconds represented at30fps446frames; source60fpsmotion detail is quantized to30fps.14.93second audio tail cut to picture duration.",
    "Fast backwards-scrub anchor is aligned to the30fps exportedframe11.766667s; original60fps frame11.75s cannot be represented exactly. Preservedv1decode revealed a22percent-counter jump at that sample;v2corrects this sampling discrepancy."
  ],
